{"suttaId":"tha-ap212","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7576,7599],"vripara":"44"},"segments":{"tha-ap212:0.3":"Pāpanivāriyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap212:1.1":"“Tissassa tu bhagavato, devadevassa tādino;","tha-ap212:1.3":"Ekacchattaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap212:2.1":"“Nivutaṃ hoti me pāpaṃ, kusalassupasampadā;","tha-ap212:2.3":"Ākāse chattaṃ dhārenti, pubbakammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap212:3.1":"“Carimaṃ vattate mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap212:3.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap212:4.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ chattamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap212:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, chattadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap212:5.1":"“Dvesattatimhito kappe, aṭṭhāsiṃsu janādhipā;","tha-ap212:5.3":"Mahānidānanāmena, rājāno cakkavattino.","tha-ap212:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap212:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pāpanivāriyo [vātātapanivāriyo (sī.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap212:8.1":"Pāpanivāriyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap212:9.1":"Kaṇikārapupphiyavaggo ekavīsatimo.","tha-ap212:10.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap212:11.1":"Kaṇikāro minelañca, kiṅkaṇi taraṇena ca;","tha-ap212:11.3":"Nigguṇḍipupphī dakado, salalo ca kuraṇḍako;","tha-ap212:11.5":"Ādhārako pāpavārī, aṭṭhatālīsa gāthakāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
